  "description": "Seo U-Yeong, a poor, unknown artist. One day, he receives an unexpected proposal. It was a letter from “Gallery B,” South Korea’s premier art gallery, expressing interest in hosting an exhibition of U-Yeong’s work… Just as U-Yeong was dismissing the outlandish offer as a hoax, the gallery’s director, Baek Sa-Hyeon, also known as “B\", appears before him. Taking advantage of U-Yeong’s desperation, he tempts him to join him in a shady scheme.\n\n*“I’m going to sell your paintings. For a very high price.”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
